Namespace-scope T*& with parenthesized initializer loses the pointer
level in parsing ([dcl.init.general]/16.2 direct-init): "invalid
implicit conversion from 'void *' to 'void'".  Root distilled from
the set_insert reduction (libc++ __tree __insert_unique's
__node_base_pointer& __child).  The `= init` spelling and local
declarations work.
